.terraform/
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately TRACKED: providers.tf floats on
# `~> 1.0.0`, so the lock is the only record of which juju provider build a
# lane actually ran against. Never add it back to this file.
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.backup
imports.attach.tf.json
terraform.tfstate.d/
attach.tfvars.json
terraform.tfstate.*.backup
